# Security floor for checkov's asteval dependency (GHSA-89v8-rhwq-hf77 /
# CVE-2026-55244 sandbox escape via BaseException subclasses, and
# GHSA-9w56-46f6-3qhx arbitrary memory R/W via numpy ctypes). Fixed in 1.0.9.
# checkov 3.2.531 requires asteval 1.0.6 exactly, so
# requirements-scanners.overrides forces 1.0.10; this floor keeps the lock
# from drifting back.
